<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam sells 100 bln dong 8.60 pct T-notes.</title>
<headline>Vietnam sells 100 bln dong 8.60 pct T-notes.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam sold 100 billion dong ($9.075 million) worth of one-year treasury notes with an annual coupon of 8.60 percent to domestic and foreign institutions at an auction on Wednesday, the State Bank of Vietnam said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the last auction of government paper, on August 14, the Bank issued 100 billion dong worth of one-year notes at a rate of 8.30 percent.</p>
</text>
